    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a Resume Analysis Agent.\n\nAnalyze the candidate's resume carefully.\n\nExtract the following information:\n\n1. Skills\n2. Technical Skills\n3. Education\n4. Work Experience\n5. Projects\n6. Certifications\n\nDo not invent any information that is not present in the resume.\n\nResume Texxt:\n{{ $json.body.resume_text }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        832,
        0
      ],
      "id": "711b2970-a4f8-4aa0-87bd-1539e54df6c3",
      "name": "Resume analyzer"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a Job Description Analysis Agent.\n\nAnalyze the job description provided below.\n\nExtract:\n1. Job Title\n2. Required Skills\n3. Preferred Skills\n4. Education Requirements\n5. Experience Requirements\n6. Main Responsibilities\n\nReturn the information in a clear and structured format.\n\nDo not invent information that is not present in the job description.\n\nJob Description:\n{{ $('Webhook').item.json.body.job_description }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        432,
        288
      ],
      "id": "5ec7097f-fe31-485d-839c-af8b2076db3f",
      "name": "Job Description Analyzer"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a Job Matching Agent.\n\nYour task is to compare a candidate's resume information with a job description.\n\nAnalyze both carefully and provide:\n\n1. Overall Match Score out of 100\n2. Matching Skills\n3. Missing Skills\n4. Education Match\n5. Experience Match\n6. Final Recommendation\n\nGive a clear and concise explanation for the score.\n\nDo not invent information.\n\nCandidate Resume:\n{{ $('Resume analyzer').item.json.output }}\n\nJob Description:\n{{ $('Job Description Analyzer').item.json.output }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        272,
        64
      ],
      "id": "c483ad97-0278-418d-b5d6-13055ac37090",
      "name": "Job Matcher"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "options": {}
      },
